          }
        },
        "description": "Validated source batches may contain held and applied animals. Potential matches are held for user confirmation in Show instead of creating duplicates. Supplied Show IDs are suggestions until confirmed. The response reports applied, ignored and pending_reviews. No external match_decision field is accepted."
      }
    },
